WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.410
I'm Kurata Sana, 1st year Jinbo
Junior High School student.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:40.160
My driver and manager, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:45.870
This is my best friend who I am
sleeping with, Hayama-kun! Just kidding.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.710
The amazing white bat, Babbit.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.840
You have this? Yeah.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.920
Aoki award winning writer Mama and
squirrel Maro-chan.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:02.350
Tears don't suit you,

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.930
you should be happy.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.350
Say farewell to your pains and
sorrows, welcome your new life!

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:14.320
Who's the guy creating such a
romantic atmosphere in the opening scene?

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.740
There is nothing
you should worry about.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.950
Leave everything to me.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.200
But...

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.700
I have to go.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.870
Who is this guy?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.130
Can he be a new character?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.630
Long time no see.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.380
You are that...

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.380
...where have I seen you before?

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:43.640
It is accessible the audience has
forgotten me since I didn't appear so long.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.810
Lend me some money?

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.020
Ah! You are...

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.600
Misako-san's ex-husband!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.520
You name is Ryosuke-san.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.770
The guy who never works seriously
always borrowing money...

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:57.440
and still hasn't given up after
getting kicked out several times.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.650
Lend me some money?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.280
Let's have a look at the following
memorable scenes:

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:02.990
At that time

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.870
Lend me some money?

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.850
Hey, Sana, you have some savings!
Why don't take some out and lend it to me?

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.890
I don't wanna!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.060
I can't take it anymore!

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.170
lf money is a problem, you can give me items that can be exchanged for money.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.180
You're welcome to come back!
We'll just kick you out again!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:11.140
The Happy-lending-money
Scheme

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.640
He's coming.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.060
What's coming?

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.480
Coming closer and closer.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.400
The milk has formed a bad omen.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.940
Is that a Babbit?

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.240
The ominous shape is floating
with the smoke...

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.620
And Maro-chan is acting strangely...

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.870
Like a punk.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.660
I can't be wrong.
He's coming.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.620
Don't scare us.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.120
What is actually coming?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.130
- A Zombie like last time.
- Zombie?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.670
Zombie, Zombie...

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.340
It might be an alien.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.050
- What about a king of all horrors?
- King of horrors?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.930
- Everything above is purely fictional.
- Fictional?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.850
Misako, lend me some money?

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.270
Lend me some money!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.320
You have to
return the money you borrowed!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.240
It's Mama's ex-husband.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.910
It has been so long.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.620
But the sad thing is he hasn't
changed at all.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.830
He's an example that will never improve.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.210
Then I should go
and prepare a little.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.170
That's right.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.510
To inform you a little...

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:32.470
This is the 'Monster-Chasing-Bazooka' used to keep determined pests away.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.190
This is the 'Thief-Catching-Machine', which can protect your family from thieves.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.230
It now comes with a lace cover.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.150
What is the situation inside?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.320
It is still very quiet.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.650
Misako!

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.490
Mama, everything's ready!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.240
Here's a hundred thousand yen.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.030
Thanks a lot, Misako!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.500
I'm going now, thanks,
I will return the money.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.000
Hey, Sana-chan, how are you?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.380
You are becoming prettier
and prettier.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.880
Manager-sama, hello, hello!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.420
Shimura-san, no need to be formal.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.840
See you!

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.970
Mama, Mama, Mama... what happened??

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.970
100,000 yen?
You'll never get it back again!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.020
- You lent him money?
- Yep.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.100
Why? Why?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.020
Why did you lend it to him today?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.310
- His eyes.
- Eyes?

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:22.730
Usually, his eyes look like dead
fish, or pancakes that have gone bad.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.030
If not, buns which have
begun to stink.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.900
Gross...

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.320
But today his eyes were serious...

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.450
So I lent it to him.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.830
- Do you get it?
- Not at all.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.130
Lend me some money,
lend me some money...

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.510
That ex-husband showing signs of
seriousness? There must be something fishy.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.180
That's what my rowdy intuition
tells me.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.840
I don't really want to care...

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.300
Nothing good comes out of helping that guy.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:57.730
Are you saying that we should just
watch him trick 100,000 yen off my Mama?

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.230
That would be bad, too...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.770
Then let's follow them for real...

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.360
Kurata, what are you doing?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.320
Eh? Kurata?

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.160
Oh, I must have heard wrong!
Heard wrong...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.370
We were almost caught.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.750
Hurry!

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.210
The trailing continues.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.340
Why would he come
to such an isolated place?

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.000
He's fishy to the max.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.170
Why am I here?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.840
It's me, Ryosuke.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.430
Who are the guys
with the rooster haircut?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.890
He hangs around those people...?

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.730
You're really annoying...

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.230
Huh? What is it?

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:49.030
Here's 100,000, I'll give you all of this if you stop hanging around Makoto-kun.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.360
Makoto-kun? Who's that?

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.120
- Eh?
- You're an idiot.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.200
Why should they stop hanging
around? I choose to stay here.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.170
Makoto-kun, your mother
is worried about you...

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.210
Shut up! Get lost!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:08.300
We'll take the money.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.840
Goodbye.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.840
Makoto-kun, wait!

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.840
Ahhh! My nose!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:16.890
What's going on?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.810
Maybe you should
go save him first.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.940
So, what exactly is
happening here?

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.360
Well. How should I put it...

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.360
I don't know what to say...

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.440
Say it already!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.410
I'm actually
planning on marriage...

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.450
Ma... Marriage??!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.830
With Makoto-kun?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.370
You're too far-fetched.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.790
Her name is Miyoko-san.
She's Makoto-kun's mother.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.370
Oh, here...

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.250
She has been raising him
all by herself.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:54.220
She's really pretty, isn't she?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.590
Makoto-kun's hair is black.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.140
He doesn't wear earrings either.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.260
When I first met him, he was a
really sweet and ordinary kid.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.850
But... ever since we talked about marriage...

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.400
he started hanging out with bad
people, and he wouldn't go home.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.110
So he opposes your marriage?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.070
Yeah, I've tried talking to him
many times...

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.070
Mama?

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.160
I forgot I still had some work to
do, excuse me.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.080
Misako...

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.500
Mama...

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.460
Is she upset that her ex-husband
is going to remarry?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:32.420
It's kinda fun to watch this happening
from an outsider's point of view.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:36.010
Looks like we don't have to worry
about her, Sana-chan.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.970
I may not be a every trustworthy man...

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.680
but I'm going to be his father

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.020
so I'm going to do all I can to
help Makoto-kun stand up again.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.900
But... there's nothing I can do.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.820
So I thought I could solve it
with money.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.900
Very typical of me, huh?

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.990
But I couldn't think of
any other way.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.820
Mr. Ex-husband!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.660
Can you call me Ryosuke?

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.580
Ex-husband Motodana Ryosuke-san.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.830
This time, this time, this time,
are you really serious?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.500
Yep, I'm very serious.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.960
Ok, then I'll help too!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.340
Really?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.050
We're on the 'pirate ship'
already anyway.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.380
Is a pirate ship like this?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.550
It'd be better if you stop being a hen.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.220
It's not the first time I,
Sana-hen, stuck my nose in other people's business.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.770
Plus, I don't even need your help.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:25.810
Oh, is that right?

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.810
That's right, that's right,
that's right!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.810
Then, Sana-chan, are you willing to see Miyoko-san?

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.320
Gave a look...

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:37.240
There's only two letter difference
between Misako-san's and Miyoko-san's names.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.780
But it has nothing to do
with this.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.700
I'm really sorry.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.700
As a mother,
it's all my fault that...

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.660
Sana-chan and her manager are so
worried.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.750
Oh, nothing like that, madam...

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.130
So beautiful...

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.920
Oh! Sorry, I was just
talking to myself.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:57.460
Makoto is a really sweet child.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.890
Maybe he's shocked because I'm
suddenly going to marry.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:06.470
But, I thought if we had three people
living together, everything would be alright...

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.560
Oh wait, excuse me.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:13.020
Why would such a babe be willing to
marry someone like Ryosuke-san?

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.690
Are you preparing the dinner?

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.690
Will we have the Stewed Meat
with Potato today?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.860
It's probably Makoto-kun's
favorite.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.860
What a great mother.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.240
But why would she and a guy like
Ryosuke-san...

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.700
Don't worry, madam.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.330
We will bring Makoto-kun back.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.710
Sana-chan,
what are you going to do?

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.540
Hohoho... I have a great idea.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:38.550
You will return the 100,000 yen you borrowed?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:38.590
A scolding Babbit

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:49.560
{parte b}

00:11:49.600 --> 00:12:02.110
Babbit's Yo Team - life's four-stringed-harp show

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.810
To become a great person.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.980
School marks are important,

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.700
Even though mothers and dads say it.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.120
But I hope that these sayings are
about a really great person.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:12.620
Isn't it, isn't it, isn't it alright too?

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.130
A life like this isn't too bad either...

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.170
- No matter...
- ...how big the problem is...

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.590
Hand it to us, pong!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:24.130
Today we're at the streets again,
looking for people who need help.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.050
- Where are we?
- I forgot.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.890
You're really following the script
and acting stupid, aren't you?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.020
Today we're seeking the person in
need of help.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.480
- Here he is?
- I'm the person in need of help.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.980
You found him already?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.230
This person in need of help is
very famous.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.480
You look very familiar...

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.150
Didn't he tricked you into working
at a wedding for free?

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.530
Really, where have I...

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.160
It's just your imagination...

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.120
Have you seen this face before?

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.410
Rhythm is the most impor-
tant thing in a variety show

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:53.330
Zenjiro-san hasn't noticed, so
let's get on with the show.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:58.290
So in other words, the task this
time is to bring Makoto-kun home.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.800
Yes, it is.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.010
Sana-chan's plan is like this...

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.590
When those junior high kids see
the cameras, they'll show the victory sign.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:09.810
While this is going on, we'll take
Makoto-kun out in a flash.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.100
Won't there be a problem,
Sana-chan?

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.520
This is very worrisome.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.230
Sorry to interrupt, hello!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:21.400
I'm the host of the
'Champion youths' interviews.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.860
Come out, the youths inside!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.320
- A TV variety show interview?
- Eh?!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.990
Look! It's Zenjiro-san and
Sana-chan!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.580
Really! We're on TV!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.000
- Let's go get their signatures!
- Kurata Sana...?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.410
- Sana-chan, please sign...
- Sign here.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.750
Attack while we have the chance!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.420
Uh-oh, there's a banana peel on
the floor.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.210
Ahhh! Why would there be banana
peels on the floor?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.800
Oh, an abacus.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.800
Hey! Why would there be an abacus
here?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.510
Whoa! Why would there be
a skateboard here?

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.390
This is a very common thing.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.480
Is today's show over? So soon?

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.860
Good work...

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.490
Hey, banana peels,
abacuses and skateboards?!

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:08.320
Isn't setting the see childish
a little low?!

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.030
Aren't you the one setting
childish traps?

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.990
I don' t know what you are
talking about...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.660
I hear from Uncle that Kurata Sana
is like his daughter.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.380
You'll do whatever
he asks you to do.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.460
What did you say?!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.000
- Sana-chan!
- Makoto-kun!

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.880
Shut up and get lost. If you don't
go, I'll hurt Kurata Sana.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.470
Sa-sa-sa-sa-sana-chan...

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.970
Oww! My nose!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.470
Makoto, you don't have to...

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.390
Shut up!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:43.400
The face is an actress's life...
what would I do if you ruin it?

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:47.530
Right, there's your mother's
words, would you like to hear?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:52.320
Stop gossiping, stop gossiping...

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.030
Stop gossiping...

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.830
Isn't that a weird voice?
That's my best friend's voice.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.000
I think I brought the wrong tape...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.290
But your mother is really worried
about you.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.460
She was making your favorite meat
and potato dish yesterday.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.670
Meat and potato?

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.590
Yeah, meat and potato.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.010
I've always hated meat and
potatoes.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.890
- Oh? Really?
- Do I look like Shinohara?

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.890
What's that?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.780
- Misako?
- Sensei? When did you get here?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.650
- Who are you?
- Mama...

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.780
Mama? She's your mama?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.910
I was going to speculate peacefully
on the development of this matter...

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:38.120
Things changed to this because of
you, right?

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.870
Get out... if you don't,
then Kurata Sana's face will...

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.000
Ho,ho, her face will change shape?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.090
- Try if you dare!
- Wait, Mama!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.930
The worst thing you've done is...

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.970
probably ring someone's doorbell
and run away, right?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:58.310
Of... of course not, I've stolen
someone's bike before!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.020
But then he gave it back...

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:01.980
Don't spit!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.350
What's going on?

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.230
I understand.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:10.110
You're doing this because you oppose your mother's wedding, isn't that right, Makoto-kun?

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.320
Ah, I'm Kouichi.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.320
- Makoto-kun?
- I'm Shingo.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.490
Just in case, I'm Kurata Sana.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.910
I'm Babbit.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.500
Old lady, you're right.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.540
Old lady?!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:25.540
I thought that if I could make mother worried then she wouldn't marry that guy.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:29.460
Then this is your own idea?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.590
I think I understand Ryosuke
very well.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.430
He might look like a gigolo...

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:36.760
Misako...

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.350
Actually, he is a gigolo.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.430
He's a nice person, has a good
personality and isn't very sly.

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:45.350
No economic abilities, if you are
with him, you're destined to work hard.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.110
Mama, you aren't helping him at all.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:49.020
I couldn't help telling the truth.

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.940
But, Ryosuke was being very
serious today.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.660
When he becomes serious,
there must be something big going on.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.620
Like when a tidal wave floods
Mount Fuji...

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.740
and the black bear living in the
mountain comes out!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.790
Ahhh! What a horrible thing!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.790
What did I come here for?

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.380
Sensei...

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.460
I'm going in.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.420
This thing
happened because of me...

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:17.180
and I thought I cold just solve it
with money.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.970
I brought both Sana-chan and
Misako trouble.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.100
Ryosuke-san...

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.560
Anyway, the point is...

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.810
What are you thinking, old lady?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.770
Old lady?!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.730
Do you know how much trouble
Ryosuke went through because of you? Brat!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.190
Wait a minute!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.320
Uncle!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:40.030
Makoto-kun, I understand that you
oppose the marriage...

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.080
because I'm a very sloppy person.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.710
But I won't be after my marriage
with Miyoko-san...

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.960
I'm not so sloppy as to not...

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.080
be a good father to you.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.460
Just pretend I'm an ordinary uncle.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.760
That is, I hope that you will
think of me as a great uncle.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.720
So, will you stop doing such
silly things?

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.930
I hope that you won't worry
Miyoko-san again.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.230
I beg you.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:07.640
Uncle...

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.020
Makoto-kun...

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.230
This has nothing to do with you...

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.780
What the hell?!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:19.110
How can you say such things at
a time like this?

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.410
If you don't want your mother to
marry, then just say so!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.040
That gigolo Ryosuke is this serious...

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.580
and you say this has nothing
to do with him!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:33.750
I wouldn't do this if Ryosuke-san was going to be my father.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.720
So you finally understand my
situation?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.930
But that guy is a definite 'no, no'!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.140
Really, really,
that guy... that guy?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.430
- That guy?
- That guy?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.140
That guy?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.140
So hot.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:44.850
That guy?

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.430
She says he's something like
a rich millionaire

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:48.980
but he really isn't anything good.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:52.230
He only thinks about himself, and
he's a cold, selfish person.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.400
To make things clear, the guys you
are talking about is your mother's...

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.450
a millionaire she's thinking about
marrying.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.160
Huh? What?

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.990
- What's this?
- Tell us what's happening, uncle.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.910
Makoto-kun, I'll ask you again.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.210
Your mother is thinking of
marrying...

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.670
Marrying a millionaire uncle.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.300
But Miyaki-san said she'd rely on me...

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.840
Oh, mom said that Ryosuke-san is
a rare, good person.

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.300
Good person?!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.510
A... Good... person??!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.350
I thought it was strange that any
girl would marry Ryosuke.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:32.980
Does that mean this has nothing to do with us, and we made such a fuss about it?

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:33.940
Looks like it.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.440
Once again,
this isn't the first time.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.690
So great! How could Ryosuke marry such a babe?

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.570
Why didn't you two say anything?

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:44.280
This is so embarrassing for us!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:47.370
That's why we kept saying it was
none of your business...

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.910
So rare you have such a serious
eyes!

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:52.500
But at last I made
a misunderstanding again.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.840
Just use this as a chance to
give up.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.670
Anyhow, no matter who the opposition is,
isn't what you're doing useless?

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:05.890
I thought mom was useless to fall in love so easily and so often.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.850
She wants them to like her, so
does everything to complement their interests.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.060
When she likes someone who likes
sexy, she dresses like this.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.730
When she likes someone who likes
bears, she dresses like this.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.690
This time, the guy actually likes
the housewife type.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.150
His favorite dish is meat and potatoes.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.700
So that's why she was making it.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.200
Mom is so stupid.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:26.320
She always gets dumped in the end.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.410
I really don't want to see mom's
tears again.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:33.000
That's why I asked them to help me
and see if this would work...

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.670
But I guess it was all wasted.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.340
In the end, only you people
worried about me.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.340
But you don't' know if that's
true, right?

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.050
You don't know.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:47.550
Miyoko-san might be coming in just
a second.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.770
But I can't see why she would
worry about me.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.230
She is very worried!

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.270
That's why she asked me.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.440
Ryosuke-san.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:21:01.320
Why don't you believe in Miyoko-san
a little longer, Makoto-kun?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.280
Uncle...

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.860
Makoto!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.320
Makoto...

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.780
Mom...

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.280
Makoto!

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.450
Mom.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.790
I've been dumped again!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:18.960
I was worried about you, so I
asked him if he could come with me and see you.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.630
I never thought he'd say that my
child is none of his business.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.630
I didn't think he was such a cold person...

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.760
Really.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.640
I thought that this time,
I'd find you a good father.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.390
It doesn't matter, as long as I'm
with you, mom.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.190
I'm sorry.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.860
If you don't mind, I could...

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.860
No way,
you have no financial support.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.320
Did you hear that?

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.490
She was using her own method of
watching out for Makoto-kun...

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.570
There's a lot of different
kinds of mothers.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.790
This pair of mother and
child isn't bad either.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:55.120
But Ryosuke-san is still the
same, always causing a big fuss.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.460
But I think I understand a little.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.210
Understand what?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.920
Why mama married a guy like
Ryosuke-san.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.920
What happened to
Ryosuke after that?

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:02.880
What happened to the ex-husband?

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:06.170
Can you stop following me around
all day?

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.840
I only let you stay because you
had nowhere else to go.

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:11.810
Just because he was dumped, geez.

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:15.020
That's right. I'm heartbroken.
Why don't you comfort me?

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:18.350
Ah, I'm not yours! Get off me!

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:19.690
Misako...

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.230
You're so annoying! Let go!

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.360
What exactly are those two...

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:27.900
What an unbelievable relationship...

00:22:27.900 --> 00:22:29.870
Maybe it is karma.

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:32.780
Misako...

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:35.370
Lend me some money?

